ion to detail<br><br>What We Oﬀer<br>• Competitive starting salary with performance-based increments<br>• Comprehensive mentorship program with senior developers<br>• Flexible work environment and learning-focused culture<br>• Opportunity to work on diverse projects and gain hands-on experience<br>• Continuous learning and professional development opportunities<br>• Potential for rapid career growth based on performance<br>• Exposure to modern development practices and technologies<br><br>Job Type: Full-time, Fresher<br>Location: Dahisar, Mumbai, Maharashtra<br><br>Required: Must be able to reliably commute or planning to relocate before starting work.<br><br>To apply -<br><br>Candidates can send updated resume at HR@Scalix.in</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd jRKCUd" aria-controls="tsuid_yC-0auvNNNulhvcP7-7ziQU_135" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCMQRQ" data-ved="2ahUKEwjr0YrxvoWXAxXbkuEIHW_3PFEQl5ACegQIIxBF"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ZFiwCf"><span class="LGwnxb JGD2rd"><span class="PBBEhf JGD2rd">Show full description</span></span><span class="w2fKdd z1asCe" style="height:20px;line-height:20px;width:20px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7.41 8.59L12 13.17l4.59-4.58L18 10l-6 6-6-6 1.41-1.41z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjr0YrxvoWXAxXbkuEIHW_3PFEQ5ZkFegQIIxBG"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjr0YrxvoWXAxXbkuEIHW_3PFEQyo8CegQIIxBH"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Scalix Enterprise Solution LLP&#39;,job_title:&#39;Fresher Software Engineer&#39;})","_yC-0auvNNNulhvcP7-7ziQU_139",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horiz